from pydantic import BaseModel, TypeAdapter", "explanation": "parse_obj_as is deprecated in Pydantic v2 in favor of TypeAdapter(T).validate_python(data). Replaced the import with TypeAdapter. Literal is added from typing for the const replacements. Field is removed because it is no longer used after the const=True usages are replaced."}, {"finding_ids": ["app/events.py:7:field-kwargs"], "search": "    type: str = Field("click", const=True)", "replace": "    type: Literal["click"] = "click"", "explanation": "The const keyword argument was removed in Pydantic v2. Per the migration guidance, use typing.Literal. Literal["click"] with default "click" keeps the same behavior: only the value "click" is accepted."}, {"finding_ids": ["app/events.py:13:field-kwargs"], "search": "    type: str = Field("scroll", const=True)", "replace": "    type: Literal["scroll"] = "scroll"", "explanation": "The const keyword argument was removed in Pydantic v2. Per the migration guidance, use typing.Literal. Literal["scroll"] with default "scroll" keeps the same behavior: only the value "scroll" is accepted."}, {"finding_ids": ["app/events.py:21:parse-obj-as"], "search": "    return parse_obj_as(List[Event], raw)", "replace": "    return TypeAdapter(List[Event]).validate_python(raw)", "explanation": "parse_obj_as is deprecated in Pydantic v2. Replaced with TypeAdapter(List[Event]).validate_python(raw), the documented equivalent, which validates the same list of Event unions."}], "notes": "Four non-overlapping edits cover all four findings. Click and Scroll are both BaseModel subclasses, so the Pydantic v2 changes apply to them. The const=True to Literal change keeps the same validation: a non-matching type value is still rejected. The "Relevant migration documentation" section was empty, so the replacements follow the guidance in the finding text (TypeAdapter for parse_obj_as, typing.Literal for const). I did not create a module-level TypeAdapter instance, to keep the change minimal and behavior-equivalent. No other lines were changed. Unused Field import removed; Literal and TypeAdapter added."}
